        <headline>Warning to Sheep Graziers for North West Coast, Midlands, Upper Derwent Valley and South East forecast districts</headline>
        <description>Sheep graziers are warned that cold temperatures, showers and westerly winds are expected during Thursday. Areas likely to be affected include parts of the North West Coast, Midlands, Upper Derwent Valley and South East forecast districts. There is a risk of losses of lambs and sheep exposed to these conditions.</description>
